{"id":"law-p038","bookId":"law","number":38,"title":"第三章行政法六、行政复议","width":1190.55,"height":841.89,"image":"data/knowledge/pages/law/law-p038.svg","dataUrl":"data/knowledge/pages/law/law-p038.json","questionCount":2,"version":1,"imagePixels":[2084,1474],"source":{"file":"27上岸村·法律常识思维导图.pdf","sha256":"13f2556a80241b0d6de1e51bc187b6ead06e073e131fa1e8b6d073fc888c8c70","page":38},"nodes":[{"id":"law-p038-n0001","text":"第三章","bbox":[66.758,313.752,51.134,17.045],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.045,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0002","text":"行政法","bbox":[122.262,313.752,51.134,17.045],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.045,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0003","text":"六、行政复议","bbox":[230.103,314.471,90.905,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":0,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0004","text":"含义","bbox":[358.885,116.405,30.302,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":1,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0005","text":"是指行政机关根据上级行政机关对下级行政机关的监督权，在当事人的申请和参加下","bbox":[425.17,94.625,560.58,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0006","text":"按照行政复议程序对行政行为进行合法性和适当性审查，并作出裁决解决行政侵权争议的活动","bbox":[425.17,138.184,621.183,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0007","text":"范围","bbox":[388.555,203.522,30.302,15.151],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":15.151,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0008","text":"审查","bbox":[454.84,181.743,30.302,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0009","text":"具体行政行为、行政不作为、行政协议、政府信息公开","bbox":[485.142,181.743,363.62,15.151],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":15.151,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0010","text":"，附带性审查部分抽象行政行为","bbox":[848.761,181.743,212.111,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0011","text":"(","bbox":[1060.873,176.145,4.833,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0012","text":"不含规章","bbox":[1065.711,181.743,60.603,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0013","text":")","bbox":[1126.314,176.145,4.833,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0014","text":"不审查抽象行政行为、国防外交、行政处分、行政调解","bbox":[454.84,225.301,363.62,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0015","text":"行政复议机关","bbox":[388.555,476.554,90.905,15.151],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.151,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"law-p038-n0016","text":"38","bbox":[587.275,810.711,16.0,21.344],"color":"#000000","fontSize":16.0,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"page-number"},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n001","text":"复议机关","bbox":[539.59,270.906,69.163,19.245],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.245,"block":10018,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999924},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n002","text":"管辖范围","bbox":[843.908,270.906,68.562,19.245],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.245,"block":10018,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999889},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n003","text":"（1）对本级人民政府工作部门作出的行政行为不服的;","bbox":[634.013,295.565,391.525,15.637],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.637,"block":10018,"line":2,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.991922},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n004","text":"（2）对下一级人民政府作出的行政行为不服的;","bbox":[632.81,316.013,344.013,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":3,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.981675},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n005","text":"（3）对本级人民政府依法设立的派出机关作出的行政行为不服的;","bbox":[634.013,338.867,476.325,16.238],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.238,"block":10018,"line":4,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.998126},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n006","text":"（4）对本级人民政府或者其工作部门管理的法律、法规、规章授权","bbox":[632.81,359.917,489.556,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":5,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999588},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n007","text":"的组织作出的行政行为不服的;","bbox":[634.614,381.568,225.533,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":6,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.996289},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n008","text":"县以上政府","bbox":[531.771,392.393,84.199,18.644],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.644,"block":10018,"line":7,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999926},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n009","text":"（5）省、自治区、直辖市人民政府同时管辖对本机关作出的行政行","bbox":[634.614,405.023,485.948,16.238],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.238,"block":10018,"line":8,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999624},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n010","text":"为不服的行政复议案件;","bbox":[635.215,426.674,173.811,16.238],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.238,"block":10018,"line":9,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.957375},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n011","text":"（6）县级以上地方各级人民政府工作部门依法设立的派出机构依照","bbox":[633.411,447.123,488.354,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":10,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.998728},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n012","text":"法律、法规、规章规定，以派出机构的名义作出的行政行为不服的","bbox":[634.614,469.977,486.549,16.238],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.238,"block":10018,"line":11,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999407},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n013","text":"行政复议案件。","bbox":[634.614,492.229,110.661,16.238],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.238,"block":10018,"line":12,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999891},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n014","text":"（1）对海关、金融、外汇管理等实行垂直领导的行政机关、税务和","bbox":[634.013,514.482,487.151,16.238],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.238,"block":10018,"line":13,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999664},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n015","text":"国家安全机关的行政行为不服的,向上一级主管部门申请行政复议;","bbox":[634.013,534.93,486.549,19.245],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.245,"block":10018,"line":14,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.990928},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n016","text":"上一级主管","bbox":[531.771,557.183,84.199,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":15,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999689},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n017","text":"（2）对履行行政复议机构职责的地方人民政府司法行政部门的行政","bbox":[634.013,558.385,487.752,15.637],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.637,"block":10018,"line":16,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.998301},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n018","text":"行为不服的，可以向本级人民政府申请行政复议，也可以向上一级","bbox":[634.614,579.435,487.752,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":17,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999244},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n019","text":"司法行政部门申请行政复议","bbox":[635.817,601.688,199.07,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":18,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.997558},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n020","text":"（1）对本部门作出的行政行为不服的;","bbox":[633.411,623.94,274.849,17.441],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.441,"block":10018,"line":19,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.998058},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n021","text":"（2）对本部门依法设立的派出机构依照法律、行政法规、部门规章","bbox":[633.411,645.591,488.955,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":20,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.998597},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n022","text":"国务院部门","bbox":[531.771,666.641,84.8,18.043],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.043,"block":10018,"line":21,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999942},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n023","text":"规定，以派出机构的名义作出的行政行为不服的;","bbox":[633.411,667.243,359.65,18.644],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.644,"block":10018,"line":22,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999095},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n024","text":"（3）对本部门管理的法律、行政法规、部门规章授权的组织作出的","bbox":[634.013,690.698,487.151,15.637],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.637,"block":10018,"line":23,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.999168},{"id":"law-p038-r01-n025","text":"行政行为不服的","bbox":[632.81,710.545,119.081,19.847],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.847,"block":10018,"line":24,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"law-p038-r01","confidence":0.99973}],"blocks":[{"id":"law-p038-b0001","text":"第三章行政法六、行政复议","bbox":[66.758,313.752,254.25,17.045],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0001","law-p038-n0002","law-p038-n0003"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0002","text":"含义","bbox":[358.885,116.405,30.302,15.151],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0004"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0003","text":"是指行政机关根据上级行政机关对下级行政机关的监督权，在当事人的申请和参加下","bbox":[425.17,94.625,560.58,15.151],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0005"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0004","text":"按照行政复议程序对行政行为进行合法性和适当性审查，并作出裁决解决行政侵权争议的活动","bbox":[425.17,138.184,621.183,15.151],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0006"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0005","text":"范围","bbox":[388.555,203.522,30.302,15.151],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0007"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0006","text":"审查具体行政行为、行政不作为、行政协议、政府信息公开，附带性审查部分抽象行政行为(不含规章)","bbox":[454.84,176.145,676.307,20.749],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0008","law-p038-n0009","law-p038-n0010","law-p038-n0011","law-p038-n0012","law-p038-n0013"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0007","text":"不审查抽象行政行为、国防外交、行政处分、行政调解","bbox":[454.84,225.301,363.62,15.151],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0014"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0008","text":"行政复议机关","bbox":[388.555,476.554,90.905,15.151],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0015"]},{"id":"law-p038-b0009","text":"38","bbox":[587.275,810.711,16.0,21.344],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0016"]},{"id":"law-p038-r01-block","text":"复议机关\n管辖范围\n（1）对本级人民政府工作部门作出的行政行为不服的;\n（2）对下一级人民政府作出的行政行为不服的;\n（3）对本级人民政府依法设立的派出机关作出的行政行为不服的;\n（4）对本级人民政府或者其工作部门管理的法律、法规、规章授权\n的组织作出的行政行为不服的;\n县以上政府\n（5）省、自治区、直辖市人民政府同时管辖对本机关作出的行政行\n为不服的行政复议案件;\n（6）县级以上地方各级人民政府工作部门依法设立的派出机构依照\n法律、法规、规章规定，以派出机构的名义作出的行政行为不服的\n行政复议案件。\n（1）对海关、金融、外汇管理等实行垂直领导的行政机关、税务和\n国家安全机关的行政行为不服的,向上一级主管部门申请行政复议;\n上一级主管\n（2）对履行行政复议机构职责的地方人民政府司法行政部门的行政\n行为不服的，可以向本级人民政府申请行政复议，也可以向上一级\n司法行政部门申请行政复议\n（1）对本部门作出的行政行为不服的;\n（2）对本部门依法设立的派出机构依照法律、行政法规、部门规章\n国务院部门\n规定，以派出机构的名义作出的行政行为不服的;\n（3）对本部门管理的法律、行政法规、部门规章授权的组织作出的\n行政行为不服的","bbox":[517.337,266.095,617.659,470.311],"nodeIds":["law-p038-r01-n001","law-p038-r01-n002","law-p038-r01-n003","law-p038-r01-n004","law-p038-r01-n005","law-p038-r01-n006","law-p038-r01-n007","law-p038-r01-n008","law-p038-r01-n009","law-p038-r01-n010","law-p038-r01-n011","law-p038-r01-n012","law-p038-r01-n013","law-p038-r01-n014","law-p038-r01-n015","law-p038-r01-n016","law-p038-r01-n017","law-p038-r01-n018","law-p038-r01-n019","law-p038-r01-n020","law-p038-r01-n021","law-p038-r01-n022","law-p038-r01-n023","law-p038-r01-n024","law-p038-r01-n025"],"sourceKind":"ocr"}],"questions":[{"id":"law-p038-q001","number":1,"type":"fill-in","answer":"具体行政行为、行政不作为、行政协议、政府信息公开","bbox":[485.142,181.743,363.62,15.151],"fontSize":15.151,"color":"#8e24aa","segments":[{"text":"具体行政行为、行政不作为、行政协议、政府信息公开","bbox":[485.142,181.743,363.62,15.151],"color":"#8e24aa"}],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0009"],"aliases":[],"context":"审查____，附带性审查部分抽象行政行为(不含规章)"},{"id":"law-p038-q002","number":2,"type":"fill-in","answer":"范围","bbox":[388.555,203.522,30.302,15.151],"fontSize":15.151,"color":"#8e24aa","segments":[{"text":"范围","bbox":[388.555,203.522,30.302,15.151],"color":"#8e24aa"}],"nodeIds":["law-p038-n0007"],"aliases":[],"context":"____"}],"rasterImages":[{"id":"law-p038-r01","bbox":[517.337,266.095,617.659,470.311],"xref":null,"pixelWidth":1027,"pixelHeight":782,"sha256":"7135967863e05c0f2144b77a8a0ce9932077878bd346a6e82ace9a26fdfa356d","engine":"RapidOCR / PP-OCRv4 / ONNX Runtime (local)","lineCount":25,"meanConfidence":0.996094,"table":{"rows":4,"columns":2,"rowBoundaries":[269.102,291.655,510.873,620.933,730.993],"columnBoundaries":[522.148,624.39,1130.786],"cells":[{"row":0,"column":0,"text":"复议机关","nodeIds":["law-p038-r01-n001"],"bbox":[522.148,269.102,102.242,22.553]},{"row":0,"column":1,"text":"管辖范围","nodeIds":["law-p038-r01-n002"],"bbox":[624.39,269.102,506.396,22.553]},{"row":1,"column":1,"text":"（1）对本级人民政府工作部门作出的行政行为不服的;\n（2）对下一级人民政府作出的行政行为不服的;\n（3）对本级人民政府依法设立的派出机关作出的行政行为不服的;\n（4）对本级人民政府或者其工作部门管理的法律、法规、规章授权\n的组织作出的行政行为不服的;\n（5）省、自治区、直辖市人民政府同时管辖对本机关作出的行政行\n为不服的行政复议案件;\n（6）县级以上地方各级人民政府工作部门依法设立的派出机构依照\n法律、法规、规章规定，以派出机构的名义作出的行政行为不服的\n行政复议案件。","nodeIds":["law-p038-r01-n003","law-p038-r01-n004","law-p038-r01-n005","law-p038-r01-n006","law-p038-r01-n007","law-p038-r01-n009","law-p038-r01-n010","law-p038-r01-n011","law-p038-r01-n012","law-p038-r01-n013"],"bbox":[624.39,291.655,506.396,219.218]},{"row":1,"column":0,"text":"县以上政府","nodeIds":["law-p038-r01-n008"],"bbox":[522.148,291.655,102.242,219.218]},{"row":2,"column"